{"reviewId": "426066534_89a1zu8mM", "review": {"abstract": "是继续走投资和出口双轮驱动的发展模式，还是转向以内需为主、消费为主的增长模式，即中国工业化演进的结构性问题。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "那么就有大聪明会问了，明明3个驱动因素，为什么只有两种模式，出口➕内需可不可以？\n\n答：现实中，“出口+内需”很难长期并存，因为高出口通常意味着本币偏弱、国内消费被压抑（如中国2000年代）；\n\n而强内需往往伴随本币升值、出口竞争力下降（如美国模式）。\n\n所以，真正具有自洽性的有效组合只有两种：以外需为牵引的“投资+出口”，和以内需为牵引的“投资+消费”", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "8311-8365", "createTime": 1778984819, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "426066534_89a1zu8mM", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 23, "likes": [{"userVid": 304283920, "name": "Thomas", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEK5iaDg8R00zqJEqtlWnlomib5MF8cmVqfSEJibBhc7nSTgmuSlfczQaTG2pXibKdWBmgplvcA1mlrTmhcvyypZR5WZDvyOGxTvAvG7MyWgGXVf9A/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCoun